 in first lien debt, senior secured loans, second lien senior secured loan unsecured debt, mezzanine debt and investments in equities. It specializes in directly investing. It specializes in middle market. It targets healthcare and pharmaceutical, aerospace and defense, high tech industries, business services, software, beverage food and tobacco, hotel gamming and leisure, banking finance insurance and in real estate sector. The fund seeks to invest across United States of America, Luxembourg, Cayman Islands, Cyprus, and United Kingdom. It invests in companies with EBITDA between $25 million and $100 million.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Alex  Chi | CEO, Head of Direct Lending, Deputy Chief Investment Officer of Carlyle Global Credit & Director | Age 52","financial_summary":["Carlyle Secured Lending, Inc. is a small-cap financial services business with a $769M market cap.","Accruals are elevated at +9.8% of assets, and Sloan showed firms building earnings through accruals rather than cash systematically underperform.","Management returns a meaningful 15.3% of market cap to owners through dividends and buybacks, a strong signal of disciplined capital allocation, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Piotroski score 1/9 \u2014 the fundamentals are deteriorating on multiple fronts","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (0.2) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Payout ratio looks stretched \u2014 the dividend\u2019s own margin of safety is thin","sev":"red","cat":"dividend"},{"text":"Accruals running hot at +9.8% of assets \u2014 earnings quality bears watching","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Financial quality metrics lag Financial Services peers","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Above-average market volatility (VIX 26)","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Late-cycle dynamics increase the probability of a slowdown","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Credit cycles and regulatory capital \u2014 losses accumulate invisibly in good years and appear all at once, and the time to worry is when underwriting standards are loosest.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Fintech disintermediation \u2014 neobanks, embedded finance, and blockchain rails are unbundling the fee streams that traditional banks took for granted.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading at a 37% margin of safety to estimated fair value \u2014 a real cushion against errors in the estimate"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Carlyle Secured Lending outlines plan to ramp SCP to $6B to $7B of assets while targeting 4 CLOs per year (NASDAQ:CGBD)","source":"seekingalpha.com","link":"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4668440-carlyle-secured-lending-outlines-plan-to-ramp-scp-to-6b-to-7b-of-assets-while-targeting-4","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793991443.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.827,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Carlyle Secured (CGBD) Q3 2026 Earnings Call Transcript","source":"fool.com","link":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/06/carlyle-secured-cgbd-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/?source=iedfolrf0000001","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793990346.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.402,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Carlyle Secured Lending declares $0.35 dividend (NASDAQ:CGBD)","source":"seekingalpha.com","link":"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4668138-carlyle-secured-lending-declares-0_35-dividend","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793973663.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.66,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["dividend"]},{"title":"Carlyle Secured Lending (NASDAQ:CGBD) Announces